    "title": "Gwen Stefani rocks the stage at The Venue at Thunder Valley - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Patricio Hernandez ,\n1 days ago Gwen Stefani returned on Dec. 6 to The Venue at Thunder Valley for the second time in two years to a nearly sold-out crowd of almost 4,500. The 90-minute show had Stefani perform her hits spanning three decades with an incorporation of not only her solo hits but the radio chart-topping songs that brought her to fame from her younger days with No Doubt. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
